flowchart LR
    A[Lead entra] --> B{Origen}
    B -->|Webhook| C[POST /api/leads/<br/>webhooks/:slug]
    B -->|Manual| D[POST /api/leads]
    B -->|WhatsApp/Make| E[Webhook generico<br/>backlog CRM-133]

    C --> F[Round-robin<br/>asigna gestor]
    D --> F
    E --> F

    F --> G[Lead status: nuevo]
    G --> H[Gestor contacta<br/>+ interacciones]
    H --> I{Resultado}
    I -->|Interesado| J[por_contactar →<br/>contactado →<br/>en_seguimiento]
    I -->|No interesado| K[no_interesado]
    J --> L{Compra?}
    L -->|Si| M[Crear conversion]
    L -->|Aun no| H

    M --> N[POST /api/conversions]
    N --> O[Lead status<br/>= convertido<br/>= CLIENTE]
    N --> P[Hook: busca regla<br/>de comision]
    P --> Q{Regla existe?}
    Q -->|Si| R[Crea commission]
    Q -->|No| S[Sin comision]

    N --> T{Importe pagado?}
    T -->|Total| U[estado_pago = pagado]
    T -->|Parcial / 0| V[Cuentas por cobrar]

    V --> W[addPayment]
    W --> X[Recalcula commission]
    W --> Y{Llega al total?}
    Y -->|Si| U
    Y -->|No| V

    U --> Z[Factura PDF<br/>backlog CRM-132]
    R --> ZA[Admin marca<br/>commission pagada]

    style O fill:#22c55e,color:#fff
    style U fill:#22c55e,color:#fff
    style V fill:#f59e0b,color:#fff
    style K fill:#ef4444,color:#fff
    style E fill:#94a3b8,color:#fff
    style Z fill:#94a3b8,color:#fff
